    "extracted_skills": "Audio-Video Generation, Diffusion Models, Digital Avatar Modeling, 3D Talking Face Generation, Text-to-Speech (TTS), NeRF, Deep Reinforcement Learning (DRL), Multi-Agent Systems (MAS), Contrastive Learning, Graph Neural Networks, Prosody Modeling, One-shot Learning, Real-time Synthesis",
    "talking_points": "Your work on MimicTalk and Real3D-Portrait pushes the frontier of few-minute personalized digital avatar generation — especially impressive given the NeRF-based realism and in-context mimicking capability.\nYou've built a strong cross-domain research profile spanning audio-driven 3D face synthesis (GeneFace series), prosody-aware TTS (CLAPSpeech, SyntaSpeech), and MARL for real-world systems like UAV navigation and smart grid control.\nAs a Ph.D. student at Zhejiang University advised by Prof. Zhou Zhao, you've published 15+ papers across top-tier venues including NeurIPS, ICLR, ACL, and IEEE TMC — a remarkable output rate and breadth.\nYour technical contributions bridge generative modeling and embodied AI: from expressive talking avatars to multi-agent coordination with graph reinforcement learning — suggesting deep systems thinking beyond narrow SOTA chasing.\nThe transition from aerospace undergrad to leading audiovisual foundation model research reflects both intellectual agility and a clear mission-driven focus on human-centered generative AI.",
