    "homepage_text": "Zichen Ding - Homepage\nHomepage\nPublications\nZichen Ding\n丁子晨\nA Researcher in OpenGVLab, Shanghai AI Laboratory.\nShanghai, China\nzichending@stu.ecnu.edu.cn\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nI am currently a Researcher in\nOpenGVLab\n, Shanghai AI Laboratory, collaborating with\nDr. Kai Chen\nand\nDr. Zun Wang\n, leading the\nOS-Copilot Team\n. Previously, I collaborated with\nDr. Wenhai Wang\nand\nDr. Zhiyong Wu\n. Before that, I received my M.Eng. degree from the\nSchool of Data Science and Engineering\n,\nEast China Normal University\nin 2025, advised by\nProf. Ming Gao\nand\nProf. Xiang Li\nin X101 lab, and B.Eng. degree at the\nSchool of Software\n,\nDalian University of Technology\nin 2022, respectively.\nMy research interests include:\nComputer-Using Agent:\nOS-Copilot\n(LLMAgents@ICLR’24),\nOS-Atlas\n(ICLR’25\nSpotlight\n),\nOS-Genesis\n(ACL’25),\nGUIMid\n(COLM’25),\nScaleCUA\n(ICLR’26\nOral\n),\nMMBench-GUI\n(CVPR’26),\nOS-Sentinel\n,\nOS-Oracle\n(CVPR’26),\nOS-Symphony\n;\nScientific Research:\nSEA\n(EMNLP’24),\nSEAGraph\n(IJCNLP-AACL’25),\nScienceBoard\n(ICLR’26);\nPrompt Tuning:\nRELIEF\n(SIGKDD’25),\nLBS3\n(ACL’25).\nMLLM:\nInternVL3.5\n,\nInternS1-Pro\n.\n★★★ Feel free to reach out to me for academic discussions and collaborations!\n🔥 News\n2026.02\n: 🥂🥂 Our paper\nOS-Oracle\nand\nMMBench-GUI\nare accepted to CVPR 2026! 🇺🇸\n2026.01\n: 🎉🎉 Our paper\nScaleCUA\n(\nOral\n) and\nScienceBoard\nare accepted to ICLR 2026! 🇧🇷\n2025.12\n: 🎉🤖 We present\nOS-Symphony\n, a holistic agentic framework for robust and generalist Computer-Using Agent!\n2025.12\n: 🔍🤖 We present\nOS-Oracle\nand\nOS-Critic Bench\n, supporting the full CUA lifecycle and closing the gap in CUA critic evaluation.\n2025.10\n: 🛡️🤖 We launch\nOS-Sentinel\nand\nMobileRisk\nto advance the safety research of mobile agents.\n2025.09\n: 🖥️📱 We released\nScaleCUA\n, the first open-source framework and dataset for truly cross-platform Computer Use Agents!\n2025.08\n: 🎉🎉 Our team relea